    "content_html": "<ul>\r\n<li>Frequency modulation is the process by which frequency of the carrier signal c(t) changes with respect to modulating signal m(t).</li>\r\n<li>FM modulated signal s(t) is a non-linear function of the modulating signal m(t), thus it is known as non-linear modulation process.</li>\r\n<li>It is more difficult than amplitude modulation.</li>\r\n</ul>",
