    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<ul>\r\n<li>When two or more sum terms are multiplied by a Boolean OR operation.</li>\r\n<li>Sum terms are defined by using OR operation and the product term is defined by using AND operation.</li>\r\n<li>f(A,B,C) = (A' + B) . (B + C')</li>\r\n</ul>",
