    "content_html": "<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\left(\\cos \\theta+i\\sin \\theta\\right)^n=\\cos(n\\theta)+i\\sin(n\\theta)$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 36</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\left[r\\left(\\cos \\theta+i\\sin \\theta\\right)\\right]^n= r^n \\left[\\cos(n\\theta)+i\\sin(n\\theta)\\right]$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 36</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
    "important": "\\[\\left(\\cos \\theta+i\\sin \\theta\\right)^n=\\cos(n\\theta)+i\\sin(n\\theta)\\]",
