    "discipline": "Electrical and Computer",
    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "chapter": "Complex Numbers",
    "topic": "Different Forms of Complex Numbers",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<ol>\r\n<li><p>Rectangular: Useful for addition and subtraction</p></li>\r\n\\[ z = x + iy\\]\r\n<li><p>Polar: Useful for multiplication and division</p></li>\r\n\\[z = r (\\cos \\theta + i \\sin \\theta)\\]\r\n<li><p>Exponential: Useful for powers and roots</p></li>\r\n\\[z = r (e^{i \\theta})\\]\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h4><span class=\"badge bg-secondary\">Conversion from Rectangular to Polar and Exponential forms:</span></h4>\r\n\r\nHere (x,y) is known and (r, $\\phi$) is unknown.\r\n\\[r = \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}\\]\r\n\\[\\phi = \\tan^{-1}\\left(\\dfrac{y}{x}\\right)\\]\r\n\r\n<h4><span class=\"badge bg-secondary\">Conversion from Polar to Rectangular form:</span></h4>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col-8\">\r\n\r\nHere (r, $\\phi$) is known and (x,y) is unknown.\r\n\\[x = r \\cos \\phi\\]\r\n\\[y = r \\sin \\phi\\]\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n     <center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/Polar_coordinate_components.svg\" alt=\"Polar coordinate components\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Polar_coordinate_components.svg\">WillowW</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/14acetPZ5-tr6ki7qeTAunU0qnF8vyNaD/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-blue-200 transition-colors\">📄 Homework</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/12ruJafl01CuJFh3eJrGa6RfOBnjh-bKl/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\">✅ Solution</a></div>",
