    "discipline": "Electrical and Computer",
    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "chapter": "Complex Numbers",
    "topic": "Roots of Complex Numbers",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<h4><span class=\"badge bg-secondary\">Euler’s identity:</span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p><span class=\"math display\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\r\ne^{j \\theta} &amp;= \\cos \\theta + j \\sin \\theta \\\\\r\ne^{-j \\theta} &amp;= \\cos \\theta - j \\sin\r\n\\theta    \\end{aligned}\\]</span></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h4><span class=\"badge bg-secondary\">Roots of complex number:</span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Take n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(^{th}\\)</span> root of the modulus\r\nand use Euler’s theorem to get multiple roots.</p>",
    "important": "",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bVjX8hFo8fumDtgScrQ4XjGp6DYhqjNE/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-blue-200 transition-colors\">📄 Homework</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zFTaom3XVrLyVrMwojpMP3s4b8AAOylg/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\">✅ Solution</a></div>",
