    "content_html": "<p>Boundary Conditions (BC) are applied in order to eliminate constants of integration.</p>\r\n<p>An example of boundary condition will be: Initial displacement, initial velocity, initial acceleration, maximum height, heat transfer through the ends, starting current flowing in the circuit and so on.</p>",
