    "content_html": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n  <div class=\"row align-items-start\">\n    <div class=\"col-8\">\n<h5><span><b>Surface Areas:</b></span></h5>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Sphere:</strong> $A = 4\\pi r^2 = \\pi D^2$</li>\n  <li><strong>Cube:</strong> $A = 6a^2$ (total surface area of 6 equal square faces)</li>\n  <li><strong>Cone:</strong>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Lateral surface area: $A_{\\text{lat}} = \\pi r L$ (where $L = \\sqrt{r^2 + h^2}$ is slant height)</li>\n      <li>Total surface area (including circular base): $A_{\\text{total}} = \\pi r L + \\pi r^2$</li>\n    </ul>\n  </li>\n  <li><strong>Cylinder:</strong>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Lateral surface area (excluding top and bottom): $A_{\\text{lat}} = 2\\pi r h = \\pi D h$</li>\n      <li>Total surface area: $A_{\\text{total}} = 2\\pi r h + 2\\pi r^2$</li>\n    </ul>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col text-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f8/Zylinder-senkr-kreis-hr-s.svg\" style=\"width:120px;\" alt=\"Cylinder\"><br/>\n      <small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zylinder-senkr-kreis-hr-s.svg\">Ag2gaeh</a>, CC BY-SA 4.0</small></small>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "important": "Surface Areas:\r\nSphere: $4\\pi r^2$\r\nCube: $6a^2$\r\nCone Lateral: $\\pi r L$\r\nCylinder Lateral: $2\\pi r h$",
