    "content_html": "<div class=\"notes-image-container my-4 text-center flex flex-col items-center\"><center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/Sinus_und_Kosinus_am_Einheitskreis_Einfach_Cos.svg\" alt=\"Trigonometric Ratios of Negative Angles\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sinus_und_Kosinus_am_Einheitskreis_Einfach_Cos.svg\">Yomomo</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/></div><p><span class=\"math display\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\sin\\ (-\\theta)  &amp;= -\\sin\\ \\theta\\\\\r\n\\cos\\ (-\\theta)  &amp;=\\ \\ \\cos\\ \\theta\\\\\r\n\\tan\\ (-\\theta)  &amp;= -\\tan\\ \\theta\\\\    \\end{aligned}\\]</span></p>",
