    "topic": "Trees",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<p>A <b>tree</b> is a non-empty set, one element of which is designed the root of the tree while the remaining elelments are partitioned into non-empty sets each of which is a sub-tree of the root.</p>\r\n\r\n<b>Tree Terminology</b>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Leaf Node:</li>\r\n<li>Path:</li>\r\n<li>Siblings</li>\r\n<li>Ancestors and Descendent</li>\r\n<li>Subtree</li>\r\n<li>Level</li>\r\n</ol>",
